{"seq":3,"slug":"aging-exception-cleanup","title":"账龄分析与积压清理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/aging-exception-cleanup","wordCount":1957,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"账龄分析与积压清理\">账龄分析与积压清理</h1><p>挂账账户里躺着的余额，是这个团队的全部未解问题之和。它有一个危险的性质：<strong>余额本身不会自己变小</strong>。如果清收速度低于新增速度，账户会单调增长，而每一条新增的挂账都比旧的那条更容易查清——因为它们新鲜、上下文完整。于是团队会自然地优先处理新差异，旧差异被不断推后，最终形成一批&quot;谁都看不懂、谁都不愿碰&quot;的僵尸挂账。账龄分析的作用就是在它变成僵尸之前把它标出来，并强制它进入处置流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-账龄分档与它的财务含义\">核心概念：账龄分档与它的财务含义</h2><p>账龄指一条挂账从入账到当前的时间。把它分档的目的不是统计，而是<strong>对每一档绑定不同的处置动作</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;挂账入账&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;0-30 天&lt;br/&gt;常规调查&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;31-60 天&lt;br/&gt;升级关注&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;61-90 天&lt;br/&gt;强制出结论&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;90+ 天&lt;br/&gt;计提 + 专项清理&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F{&quot;调查有结论？&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G[&quot;核销 / 转应收&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;否,且超 90 天&quot;| H[&quot;按政策计提&lt;br/&gt;保留追索权&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;账户余额下降&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[\"挂账入账\"] --&gt; B[\"0-30 天&lt;br/&gt;常规调查\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"31-60 天&lt;br/&gt;升级关注\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"61-90 天&lt;br/&gt;强制出结论\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"90+ 天&lt;br/&gt;计提 + 专项清理\"]\n  B --&gt; F{\"调查有结论？\"}\n  F --&gt;|\"是\"| G[\"核销 / 转应收\"]\n  F --&gt;|\"否,且超 90 天\"| H[\"按政策计提&lt;br/&gt;保留追索权\"]\n  G --&gt; I[\"账户余额下降\"]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>分档依据来自会计上对账龄的标准用法：应收款按拖欠时长分组（常见为 current、1–30、31–60、61–90、90+ 天），越旧的分组被视为越不可收回，账龄表用于按风险分类债务并估计不可收回金额（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Accounts_receivable\">Accounts receivable</a>）。挂账余额的分析结构与此同源，只是&quot;债务人&quot;变成了&quot;未查明的差异&quot;，而&quot;可收回性&quot;变成了&quot;可查明性&quot;。</p>\n<p>一个必须建立的区分：<strong>账龄不是&quot;挂了多久&quot;，而是&quot;挂了多久且仍未动&quot;</strong>。一张 60 天前挂账但昨天刚更新过证据的工单，与一张 60 天前挂账且最近一次动作在 55 天前的工单，风险完全不同。因此账龄分析要同时看两个时间：<code>aging_days</code>（入账至今）与 <code>idle_days</code>（最后一次实质动作至今）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账龄看板的数据模型与查询\">账龄看板的数据模型与查询</h2><h3 id=\"余额的时间切片\">余额的时间切片</h3><p>&quot;当前账龄分布&quot;只回答今天的问题，看板必须能回答&quot;这个分布是怎么变成现在这样的&quot;。做法是按周快照余额而不是实时计算——实时计算在数据量大时昂贵，且历史无法重现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE suspense_aging_snapshot (&#10;  snapshot_date  DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  account_code   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_code   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  band           TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (band IN (&#39;0_30&#39;,&#39;31_60&#39;,&#39;61_90&#39;,&#39;90_plus&#39;)),&#10;  open_count     INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  open_amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  oldest_aging_days INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (snapshot_date, account_code, channel_code, currency, band)&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO suspense_aging_snapshot&#10;SELECT current_date,&#10;       e.account_code,&#10;       e.channel_code,&#10;       e.currency,&#10;       CASE WHEN current_date - e.value_date &lt;= 30 THEN &#39;0_30&#39;&#10;            WHEN current_date - e.value_date &lt;= 60 THEN &#39;31_60&#39;&#10;            WHEN current_date - e.value_date &lt;= 90 THEN &#39;61_90&#39;&#10;            ELSE &#39;90_plus&#39; END,&#10;       count(*),&#10;       sum(e.remaining_minor),&#10;       max(current_date - e.value_date)&#10;FROM suspense_open_item e&#10;WHERE e.remaining_minor &lt;&gt; 0&#10;GROUP BY 1,2,3,4,5&#10;ON CONFLICT (snapshot_date, account_code, channel_code, currency, band)&#10;DO UPDATE SET open_count = EXCLUDED.open_count,&#10;              open_amount_minor = EXCLUDED.open_amount_minor,&#10;              oldest_aging_days = EXCLUDED.oldest_aging_days;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> suspense_aging_snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_date  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_code   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  band           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (band </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0_30'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'31_60'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'61_90'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90_plus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  open_count     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  open_amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  oldest_aging_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (snapshot_date, account_code, channel_code, currency, band)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suspense_aging_snapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0_30'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '31_60'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '61_90'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '90_plus'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remaining_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suspense_open_item e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remaining_minor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (snapshot_date, account_code, channel_code, currency, band)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DO </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> open_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">open_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              open_amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">open_amount_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              oldest_aging_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> EXCLUDED</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">oldest_aging_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>快照表让&quot;上周 90+ 档有 1,240 笔、本周 1,390 笔&quot;这类问题变成一次普通查询，而不是需要重放历史。</p>\n<h3 id=\"清理优先级的排序\">清理优先级的排序</h3><p>清收不是按账龄从大到小排——金额很小的超期项排在前面会浪费产能。排序应该是&quot;金额 × 超期程度&quot;的组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>cleanup</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>remaining_minor</mtext><mtext>unit</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>aging_days</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{cleanup}} = \\log_{10}\\left(1 + \\frac{\\text{remaining\\_minor}}{\\text{unit}}\\right) \\times f(\\text{aging\\_days})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cleanup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unit</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">remaining_minor</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">aging_days</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个在 90 天后加速的权重函数（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>90</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(d) = 1 + (d/90)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/90</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），<code>unit</code> 是该币种的最小货币单位（用来把不同币种的绝对金额拉回可比尺度）。用对数压制金额的量级差异，是为了避免一张 100 万美元的挂账永远占据队首，而 200 张 500 美元的挂账（合计同样可观、且更容易查清）永不被处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT s.item_id, s.case_id, s.channel_code, s.currency,&#10;       s.remaining_minor,&#10;       current_date - s.value_date                                   AS aging_days,&#10;       current_date - s.last_action_date                             AS idle_days,&#10;       round(log(10, 1 + s.remaining_minor / 100.0)&#10;             * (1 + power((current_date - s.value_date) / 90.0, 2)), 2) AS cleanup_score&#10;FROM suspense_open_item s&#10;WHERE s.remaining_minor &lt;&gt; 0&#10;  AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM case_sla_state c&#10;     WHERE c.case_id = s.case_id AND c.current_state = &#39;pending_external&#39;&#10;  )&#10;ORDER BY cleanup_score DESC&#10;LIMIT 200;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remaining_minor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                   AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aging_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_action_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                             AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idle_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remaining_minor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> power</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((current_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cleanup_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suspense_open_item s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remaining_minor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_sla_state c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">current_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending_external'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cleanup_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>排除 <code>pending_external</code> 是有意的：那些工单的时钟本就是暂停的（见 <a href=\"../case-investigation-sla/case-sla-escalation\">工单 SLA 与升级</a>），把它们排进清收队列只会产生&quot;为什么这张还没动&quot;的噪声。它们应该出现在<strong>暂停超期</strong>的专项列表里，而不是常规清收队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计提-让不可查明的差异有归属\">计提：让不可查明的差异有归属</h2><h3 id=\"何时计提\">何时计提</h3><p>90+ 天档位的挂账如果仍无结论，继续挂在暂记账户上是不合适的：审计上会质疑&quot;这笔钱到底是不是资产&quot;。处理方式是按政策计提减值，即把它从暂记账户转到损失准备，同时保留追索权——这样账面反映的是&quot;预计收不回的部分&quot;，而不是&quot;还没查清&quot;。</p>\n<p>这一处理对应会计上的损失或有事项处理原则：当损失既可能发生又可合理估计时，才在账上确认；不满足这两个条件的部分通过披露说明（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contingent_liability\">Contingent liability</a>）。对账挂账的计提政策正是这个原则的工程化版本，其中&quot;可能&quot;与&quot;可估计&quot;都被映射成了具体的账龄阈值与金额阈值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账龄档</th>\n<th>计提比例（基准）</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0–60 天</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>仍在正常调查窗口内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>61–90 天</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>强制出结论，但尚不计提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>91–180 天</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>多数已难以查明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>181–365 天</td>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td>保留追索权但预计收不回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 365 天</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>全额计提，专项清理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计提比例是<strong>政策参数而非技术常量</strong>，必须可配置且带版本——因为审计口径会变，而历史计提不能因为政策变更而被追溯修改。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计提分录与它的可逆性\">计提分录与它的可逆性</h3><p>计提不是核销，它不移除追索权：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;posting_kind&quot;: &quot;suspense_provision&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source_type&quot;: &quot;suspense_aging_run&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source_id&quot;: 20260927,&#10;  &quot;idempotency_key&quot;: &quot;provision:20260927:FX_SUSPENSE:USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;entries&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;account_code&quot;: &quot;6701&quot;, &quot;dr_cr&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;amount_minor&quot;: 4200000, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;, &quot;narrative&quot;: &quot;挂账减值损失&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;account_code&quot;: &quot;1249&quot;,&#10;      &quot;dr_cr&quot;: &quot;C&quot;,&#10;      &quot;amount_minor&quot;: 4200000,&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;      &quot;narrative&quot;: &quot;待查差异减值准备&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;policy_version&quot;: &quot;provision-policy-2026Q3&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"posting_kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspense_provision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suspense_aging_run\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20260927</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"idempotency_key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"provision:20260927:FX_SUSPENSE:USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"6701\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dr_cr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"D\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4200000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"narrative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"挂账减值损失\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"account_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1249\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dr_cr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4200000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"narrative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"待查差异减值准备\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"policy_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"provision-policy-2026Q3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计是<strong>减值准备是独立科目（1249），不冲减挂账本金（1241）</strong>。这样做的四个好处：挂账余额保持完整，账龄统计不被计提污染；未来若查明可以冲回准备而不影响原挂账记录；审计能同时看到&quot;挂了多少&quot;与&quot;预计损失多少&quot;两个数；追索权在法律上仍然存在，账上也有依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"积压清理的专项机制\">积压清理的专项机制</h2><h3 id=\"批量归因与合并处理\">批量归因与合并处理</h3><p>积压里的很大一部分是<strong>同根因的批量差异</strong>——某渠道某天的一批文件格式变更导致 300 笔差异，或某次费率调整导致 1,200 笔小额手续费差异。逐笔处理这 1,500 笔是纯粹的浪费，正确做法是批量归因后合并核销：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>批次规模</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>审批要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤ 20 笔</td>\n<td>逐笔</td>\n<td>按原矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21–500 笔</td>\n<td>批量归因，合并核销</td>\n<td>按合计金额的矩阵，+1 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 500 笔</td>\n<td>专项立项</td>\n<td>财务负责人 + 内控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合并核销在账务上是<strong>一条多对一的分录</strong>（多笔挂账 → 一个损益科目），而不是把 300 笔差异轧成一条记录。原始差异记录必须逐条保留并关联到同一个核销决策，否则 <a href=\"../../exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a> 会丢失样本量——而样本量恰恰是判断&quot;费率是否系统性变更&quot;的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"长期滞留项的复盘节奏\">长期滞留项的复盘节奏</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节奏</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td>清收队列更新 + 90+ 新增项审查</td>\n<td>清收周报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每月</td>\n<td>账龄快照对比 + 计提执行</td>\n<td>计提分录 + 环比变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每季</td>\n<td>90+ 滞留项专项复盘</td>\n<td>根因报告，回流治理章节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每年</td>\n<td>计提政策与容差阈值重标定</td>\n<td>政策修订</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>季度复盘是最容易被跳过的一环，而它恰恰是唯一能把&quot;处理积压&quot;变成&quot;减少积压&quot;的环节。它的产出必须落到具体的规则修订上——收紧某渠道的容差、给某类差异加硬规则、或推动渠道侧修复——否则清理就只是在同一个池子里反复打捞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>账龄是&quot;挂了多久且仍未动&quot;，要同时看 <code>aging_days</code> 与 <code>idle_days</code>；分档的意义在于绑定不同的处置动作。</li>\n<li>余额按周快照而非实时重算，让&quot;分布怎么变成现在这样&quot;可查且廉价。</li>\n<li>清收排序用金额对数 × 超期加速权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=\\log_{10}(1+r/u)\\cdot f(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，避免大额项长期霸占队首；<code>pending_external</code> 项排除在常规队列外。</li>\n<li>90+ 天无结论的挂账按政策计提，但<strong>准备科目独立于挂账本金</strong>，保留追索权与账龄可分析性。</li>\n<li>批量同根因差异合并核销，但原始记录逐条保留并关联同一决策，以保住治理分析的样本量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>账龄数据是治理章节的直接输入——清收结论与滞留根因构成下一章 <a href=\"../../exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a> 的主要素材。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"账龄分析与积压清理","id":"账龄分析与积压清理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：账龄分档与它的财务含义","id":"核心概念-账龄分档与它的财务含义"},{"level":2,"text":"账龄看板的数据模型与查询","id":"账龄看板的数据模型与查询"},{"level":3,"text":"余额的时间切片","id":"余额的时间切片"},{"level":3,"text":"清理优先级的排序","id":"清理优先级的排序"},{"level":2,"text":"计提：让不可查明的差异有归属","id":"计提-让不可查明的差异有归属"},{"level":3,"text":"何时计提","id":"何时计提"},{"level":3,"text":"计提分录与它的可逆性","id":"计提分录与它的可逆性"},{"level":2,"text":"积压清理的专项机制","id":"积压清理的专项机制"},{"level":3,"text":"批量归因与合并处理","id":"批量归因与合并处理"},{"level":3,"text":"长期滞留项的复盘节奏","id":"长期滞留项的复盘节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"核销审批与权限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/writeoff-approval-control"},"next":{"title":"差异趋势与根因分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause"}}